  "body": "Imagine waking to uninterrupted sea views, cooling off in your own pool on a summer afternoon, then finishing the day in the spa as the sky puts on a show. 23 Duncansby Road is where everyday living takes on a distinctly holiday-like feel.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, the Hauraki Gulf takes centre stage, with expansive water views providing an ever-changing backdrop to the beautifully appointed interiors. The renovation has brought a considered sense of style and quality throughout, while generous living spaces connect effortlessly with the outdoors.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the part that really sets this home apart... Your own private resort awaits outside. A swimming pool for long summer days, spa for unwinding under the stars, sauna for a little everyday indulgence and an outdoor fireplace that makes entertaining long into the evening feel effortless. Whether it's a morning coffee overlooking the water, a lazy afternoon poolside or drinks with friends as the sun goes down, this is outdoor living done exceptionally well.\r\n\r\nInside, the home is equally impressive, with 220sqm of beautifully renovated living offering three bedrooms and three bathrooms, generous open-plan living and plenty of flexibility for family and guests. The master suite is a peaceful retreat in its own right, while the home's elevated position ensures that those incredible views remain part of everyday life.\r\n\r\nSet on a substantial 845sqm site, there's also more flexibility here than meets the eye. The property has previously held council approval for a two-bedroom minor dwelling, offering exciting possibilities for extended family, guests or future plans (subject to the relevant approvals).\r\n\r\nAnd while it may feel wonderfully removed from the everyday, you're still right in the heart of the Hibiscus Coast lifestyle - close to Stanmore Bay Beach, local schools, shops, cafes and everything that makes this corner of Auckland such a sought-after place to call home.\r\n\r\nWith Penlink now under construction and set to significantly enhance connectivity to this sought-after coastal community, the area is well placed for the future, adding further confidence in its long-term appeal and value.\r\n\r\nHighlights\r\n* Uninterrupted Hauraki Gulf and coastal views\r\n* 220sqm beautifully renovated home\r\n* Substantial 845sqm site\r\n* Three bedrooms and three bathrooms\r\n* Resort-style swimming pool\r\n* Spa and sauna\r\n* Outdoor fireplace and entertaining areas\r\n* Multiple living spaces\r\n* Elevated, private position\r\n* Potential to add a two-bedroom minor dwelling\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/M115\r\n\r\n** Settlement and deposit terms flexible\r\n** Other agents: conjunctionals welcome.",
